Live eye-tracking filter and Far depth curve (native/quadviews/dcsvr_live.h; tested by tests/quadviews-live): the reload
of 0016 now also applies dcsvr_saccade_widening/speed/lead_ms/max_extend/hold_ms/end_speed/tail, dcsvr_gaze_deadzone and
dcsvr_lost_ease_ms (handed to xrLocateViews' thread, which takes them with a try-lock before its next frame; the filter's
state stays), and Far depth's curve (dcsvr_far_depth_preset, _world_ipd, _z0_m, _gamma: constant-buffer values, the
start-up parse's rules) and its key (dcsvr_far_depth_toggle; held until released, no key: Far depth back on). Far depth
on/off, eye tracking itself and every other key still wait for the next start.

